  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760354,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1st Intro: A Commodore 64 Football Management Classic\n\nStep into the boots of a manager in *1st Intro*, a thrilling football management simulation for the Commodore 64! This isn't just about kicking a ball; it's about building a dynasty. Choose from a selection of English clubs and guide them through the highs and lows of the season, battling for promotion, avoiding relegation, or simply striving for glory.\n\nManage every aspect of your team, from training regimes and player transfers to tactical formations and match-day decisions. Scour the leagues for promising young talent, negotiate shrewd deals, and nurture your squad to peak performance.  Experience the tension of match day as you witness your strategies unfold on the pitch. \n\nFollowing each game, detailed reports reveal player injuries, results from rival matches, and crucial financial updates – keeping you on your toes and demanding strategic thinking. *1st Intro* delivers a deep and rewarding management experience, capturing the excitement and challenge of professional football on the iconic Commodore 64. Can you lead your team to victory?"
    },
